&_nc_oc=Adrbd61flTtQdglHWYZVx5d7m_aDAwJLROc4xPPy2fQf4ur9GSTFjoyl0eCsTS_IHMw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9Eu_6ot29rH8Cz8XzRVVNTSCx1n7IiPZkr3Hk2kgr9hw&oe=6A3FE93E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hq4iauAyyUIQ7kNvwEcu8yw&_nc_oc=AdocoSdjFIGLcH2pb5yH_u-Q27PdODIhOiNOUMQobyiKSWDfCxeWGy8St4smDVZZdEY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9tfggm6om85OwdGzfamGoAPOaRbXL-AWBasJuBPhF9sw&oe=6A3FC1FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aiIEVahqIe4Q7kNvwG5ZK0D&_nc_oc=AdoCkQj_EzKw30nGBPEegXcwuwM3PB0adTpn6o_g-8AVoogLn6lveoRsXOJCSoDLmlM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_9R3wr8quZy3D7rq6HTh-LEKGrwpAo2s6Wq53bHFPaug&oe=6A3FE087"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3pHVTOpNyWEQ7kNvwE4lSs6&_nc_oc=AdrtZv90lZ8wjtn_gWfnRNCiGyFHCmZelv89OV2eRjGE9UIkZuCbvVmmdp_mMduoBjY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9ZvI0dAMZ2K_MfJstCRV2YCcBSanOLkPnM033RxWjcrA&oe=6A3FCC55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5KIWVaqUOpMQ7kNvwEdDpdl&_nc_oc=AdoXTfCHg4DAnZUBUvERCowDTV1WENtbDqu244EA-ULJTaQh-94l1QlP4Ju4Yeq8_do&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_P6CdOGNJCgQj7EW6ugHngg1TtoBB17IO3VM-0SNzRiA&oe=6A3FD8E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.